# ~/.hq: what hq has lived is committed (the hq-state repo); this Mac's own things never are. Everything is ignored
# except what is listed here, so a new file (a secret, a database, a log) stays out of git unless someone adds it.
*
!.gitignore
!user.md
!projects.json
!agents.json
!private-words
!projects/
!projects/**
